<p>Entomb yourself in a wall of stone for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">8, 10, 12, 13, 15</acronym> turns.</p><p>At level 4, it becomes targetable.</p><p>Any hostile creature caught in the radius will also suffer <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">153, 205, 246, 281, 312</acronym> physical damage.</p><p>Duration and damage will improve with your Spellpower.</p>